## Contract pinned

- `conformalQuantile([], 0.1)` → `+∞`
- `conformalQuantile` n=5, α=0.1 (rank = ceil(0.9×6)−1 = 5 ≥ n) → `+∞`
- `conformalQuantile` n≥9, α=0.1 → finite quantile (last sorted score)
- `cqrInterval` with n=5 calibration → `qhat=+∞`, lo all `−∞`, hi all `+∞` (No-Bet)
- `cqrInterval` with n≥9 and residuals outside [qLoCal, qHiCal] → finite nonnegative `qhat`, outward expansion (`lo = qLo − qhat`, `hi = qHi + qhat`)
- empty `yCal` → original bands, `qhat=0`
- `CQR_PRODUCT_NOTES.defaultOff === true`, `unlocksProven === false`

## API note

`cqrInterval` takes positional args `(qLo, qHi, yCal, qLoCal, qHiCal, alpha=0.1)`, not an options object. Fixture for the finite path places `yCal` outside `[0, 2]` so residuals are nonnegative and expansion is outward (inside-band yCal produced negative qhat and looked like a contraction).

